Three protobuf schemas under src/stadiacast/schemas/ are reproduced from the Stadia
Controller firmware (ota.282115), which embeds them as serialized descriptors:

    input.descriptor                 and its rendering input.proto
    webrtc_sdp.descriptor            and its rendering webrtc_sdp.proto
    yeti_clientanalytics.descriptor  and its rendering yeti_clientanalytics.proto

These schemas, including the names in them, are Google's work. They are not covered by
